OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FFurther
OL,6,Fshowers will move in from the west
OL,7,Fovernight, some of which could be
OL,8,Fheavy at times. More isolated in the
OL,9,Feast with clearer spells. A cooler
OL,10,Fnight for many.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FSunshine and showers on
OL,13,FThursday. Showers turning thundery at
OL,14,Ftimes as they move their way
OL,15,Feastwards. Some hail possible too.
OL,16,FSlightly cooler than Wednesday, but
OL,17,Fwarm in any sunny spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
